  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Running Away With What Freud Said**: back after 89 archived shows (2657 days); rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **Ice Cream, Cobra Man**: back after 57 archived shows (1900 days); rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **Move (Chicago 196?)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **This Magic Moment**: back after 57 archived shows (1900 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Don’t Take the Dogs Away**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **One Winter at Point Alpha Privative**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Solomon Revisited**: back after 87 archived shows (2555 days); rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **Going To Alaska**: back after 55 archived shows (1828 days); rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **MountainGoats2014-06-15.mix.flac16** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 25 songs; 94 min [1]\n- **tmg2014-06-15.both**: audience recording; 25 songs; 94 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **MountainGoats2014-06-15.mix.flac16**: taped by anonymous; transferred by BLG; source: [SBD > M10] + [Schoeps CCM4 > Tinybox > M10] => FLAC [1]. Also: Mix of a soundboard feed and a Schoeps CCM4 microphone recording run through a Tinybox, both going into an M10 recorder; Mastering by BLG: edits, alignment and mixdown in Adobe Audition, then iZotope Ozone 5 processing, WavePad tracking, xACT tagging, FLAC encoding [1]\n- **tmg2014-06-15.both**: taped by The Annotated Mountain Goats; source: Audience recording [2]",
